  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faffiliate.godlike.host%252fsatux\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/628529/description_27a50d5b-c441-41f3-90d3-67b85aa00835.png\" alt=\"Satux 推廣活動\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></a><strong>軍事裝甲模組</strong>新增一系列現代軍事風格的裝甲，非常適合角色扮演或戰爭主題的伺服器。<br>專為與 <strong>MrCrayfish 的槍械模組</strong>或 <strong>MrCrayfish 的車輛模組</strong>完美搭配而設計，提供多種裝甲顏色以及新的<strong>銀</strong>物品，讓角色扮演體驗更加沉浸。</p><p>無論你要為戰術戰鬥整裝待發，還是只想擁有逼真的軍事外觀，這個模組都能滿足你的需求。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/628529/description_e162e843-3ad3-44a3-b20d-09bd9ac24f23.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"238\" height=\"310\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/628529/description_5e1d6b98-e391-4dbe-bf3a-250c7b9bcf52.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"257\" height=\"310\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/628529/description_691fa2c5-6cdc-40fe-990a-209a311c9ae3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"237\" height=\"310\"></p><pre style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</pre>",
